00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:49.080
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 2: The Time]  
The Eto-shin Selection Festival (ETM12) 
is held for a sixty day period every sixty years 
in accordance with the sexagenary cycle, 
with the goal of revitalizing Sol/Lull in the 
gods' realm, the Eto realm, and the human realm.</b>

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:54.920
And so...

00:10:55.550 --> 00:11:00.180
<b>Usa-tan Productions
  The Nya-tan Improvement
 Project Proposal</b>

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:00.180
I've prepared a proposal for the 
improvement of Nya-tan's character!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.470
Uh... Who do you think you are?

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.850
Forgive my delayed introduction.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:10.560
<b>Usa-tan Company, CEO 
Usa-tan Productions, Producer 
Usa-tan Moving Center, Inc., Representative 
Usa-tan Visual Effects, Inc., Managing Director 
Usa-tan Books, Inc., Managing Director 
UTC Electronics, President 
UTC Foods, Inc., Representative Director</b>

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:08.490
I'm the CEO of Usa-tan Company,

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:12.060
producer of Usa-tan Productions, 
and much more.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.420
O-Oh... Well, thank you.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.940
Wait, what does that mean?!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.570
I am a professional producer, 
or Usa P.P. for short!

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:21.410
Seriously?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.240
Any living creature, in my hands,

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.590
is freed from lack of personality!

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:28.160
I'll produce you perfectly!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.160
UTC will continue to respond 
to its customers' voices.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.160
<b>No 1. In Customer Satisfaction</b>

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.940
Wow!

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:32.010
I didn't know Usa-tan was so amazing!

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:35.420
So that's how she was able to point 
out our weaknesses so accurately!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.010
Wow, those two are so pure...

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.810
So that's why! Usa P.P. is so cool!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:39.540
This all smells way too fishy.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.900
Yeah! Usa P.P. is so cool!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:42.910
I wonder if she realizes that 
abbreviation sounds like

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:41.800
Too cool!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.720
Too awesome!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.960
I wanna be like P.P.!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.350
it's meant to censor a word 
we can't say on air...

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:44.970
Me, too!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.870
But I detect an erotic sensibility to this

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:47.840
So cool!

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.740
frequent use of "P."

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:49.430
So cool!

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.140
Anyway, is that helicopter okay?

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:54.770
Oh, you didn't notice? It was CG.

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:55.780
Seriously?!

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:57.360
But it seemed so real!

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:59.790
We used a 4D hologram system

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.750
along with our mastery 
of stereophonic sound.

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.850
And to achieve further realism,

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:06.890
we generated three-dimensional 
vibration using a giant air blower

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.870
to perfectly recreate a crash scene.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.290
My house was modified without my knowledge?!

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:14.220
Now, that's enough idle chatter.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.670
<b>Investigating the Possibility 
of a Cat Joining the Chinese
 Zodiac Through ETM12</b>

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.410
Firstly, I've investigated the 
possibility of a cat joining

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:25.030
the Chinese zodiac through ETM12.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.430
What?!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.680
Oh, she's interested.

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.860
What was the result?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.100
<b>Wants a Cat</b>

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.580
These three want a cat 
in the Chinese zodiac.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.440
<b>Master of Spiritual Power, Dora-tan</b>

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:35.900
These are the three masters

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.060
<b>Master of Strength and 
Techniques, Shima-tan</b>

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.400
who build Nya-tan's spiritual power, 
teach her strength and techniques,

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.780
<b>Master of Wisdom, Uri-tan</b>

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:40.780
and impart wisdom to her.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.550
Uri-tan, you're Nya-tan's master, too?

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.390
Yep, yep.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.270
And Chu-tan, who resents Nya-tan,

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.780
<b>The Rat (Zi Shu), Chu-tan</b>

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.790
<b>Doesn't Want a Cat</b>

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:50.040
is one of the four members who 
don't want a cat in the zodiac.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:53.250
And these are the ones who don't 
care whether a cat joins or not.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:54.120
<b>Don't Care Either Way</b>

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.540
They don't count.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.710
That's true...

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.750
When you put it that way, I guess we don't.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.760
<b>The Ox (Chou Niu), Mo-tan</b>

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:00.480
This one is too perverted to be counted.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.760
Oh, my God!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.470
So, with a count of three against four,

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.420
Nya-tan cannot join the 
Chinese zodiac. The end.

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.890
What kind of half-baked 
investigation is that?!

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:11.490
Therefore,

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:15.020
I have drawn up a plan to produce 
you so that your character

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:18.100
will stand out even if 
you're not in the zodiac.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:20.280
Oh, really? You did?

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:21.400
She's being toyed with.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.520
With this plan, you'll become Neo Nya-tan.

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:29.410
Neo... Nya-tan...

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:30.970
Don't be proud.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:33.910
Leave everything to Usa P.P.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.220
Usa P P P P P P P...

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:41.750
She's obviously using mind control!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.760
No!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:45.070
Wake up, Nya-tan!

00:13:46.810 --> 00:13:48.260
What was I just...

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.640
I almost had her...

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.450
Nya-tan... Nya-tan...

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.450
Usa P.P., us next!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.400
Produce us!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:54.980
What?

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.970
Show us what a pro can do!

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.540
I'll work hard!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:05.430
My producer's soul is trembling!

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.950
P.P. Beam!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.250
Production complete.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:23.450
I've given you two the characters 
of long-lost twin boys.

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:28.510
She used the dog and monkey's overlapping 
personalities to make them twins! Yep, yep!

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:30.520
So it's okay...

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.640
...that we overlap!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.070
I turn your weaknesses into strengths.

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:39.520
That's the true value of Usa P.P.!

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.590
Bravo!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.150
I'm in!

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.380
I'll take that proposal of yours!

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.820
Let's see... In that case...

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:53.780
I'll need you to pay the 100 
million yen fee in advance.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:54.930
Why 100 million?!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:15:02.330
<b>Solo Debut Initial Costs</b>

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:58.100
We start with the initial costs for your 
solo debut after determining your character,

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:04.040
<b>Yacht Rental Cost</b>

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.460
then we charter a yacht for 
your first public appearance,

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:04.040
then we build a recording studio,  
secure a concert venue,

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:05.340
<b>Recording Studio</b>

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:10.340
<b>Solo Debut Initial Costs                     Concert Venue Reservation</b>

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.800
the first tuna auction,  
full-body spa treatments, etc.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:10.340
<b>Yacht Rental Cost                              First Tuna Auction Overhead Costs</b>

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:10.340
<b>Recording Studio                               Full-Body Spa Treatment Costs</b>

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.340
Production by Usa P.P. requires 
the appropriate funding.

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:13.780
That's brutal! And after 
you got me all motivated!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:17.210
You worked Key-tan and Inu-tan over 
completely and didn't charge a thing!

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:21.070
They are fellow Zodiac members. 
You're only an Eto-musume.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:21.400
<b>Eto-shin</b>

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.400
<b>Eto-musume</b>

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:24.110
A difference in treatment 
is only to be expected.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:28.240
Then I challenge you to a battle!

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:31.490
If I win, you'll produce me for free!

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.450
And you'll give me your Sol/Lull Seal, too!

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.240
That sounds interesting.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.040
Then...

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:40.750
Let us begin the battle!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.750
<b>Approved</b>

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.290
Eto-tama! Sol/Lull Charge!

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:42.920
<b>Rabbit</b>

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:01.950
Rabbit Eto-shin, Usa-tan!

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.830
What the heck?!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.690
You look disgraceful.

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:20.260
Choose your rules!

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.440
Now, now. Would you like some tea?

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:23.250
Thanks.

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.250
Wait, no!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.570
Fight me!

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:32.970
"Look that way."

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.330
We will play three times.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.300
Okay.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.960
If you beat me even once,

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.510
I'll give you my Sol/Lull Seal...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.010
And I'll produce you...

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:49.270
For free!

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:56.280
She may have a bit of a disadvantage 
against that rule.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.090
She's been following

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:00.740
Usa-tan's finger this whole time...

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:03.020
Time for round one!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.540
B-Bring it on!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:08.940
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.840
Look...

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.480
She shut her eyes!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:18.850
That's impressive, for Nya-tan!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:19.620
...that way!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.620
It worked!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.680
Time Stop!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.150
What did you do?!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.150
Looks like I've won the first round.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:36.340
Didn't Usa-tan say something 
really clearly just now?

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:37.190
Yep, yep.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.620
Oh! Fantastic!

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.490
Time for the second round.

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:43.200
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.280
Look...

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:49.020
That thing's totally suspicious!

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:53.210
Time Stop!

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:59.680
Silly. Did you think time would stop?

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.760
This is your last chance, Nya-tan.

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:06.670
She lost the second round, too.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:08.970
That clock doesn't stop time?

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:10.490
It's very curious...

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:12.550
I know! Let's find out!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.190
How?

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.560
We'll rewind it and watch 
it frame-by-frame.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.700
You can do that?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:19.520
This is the first round.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.840
<i>Rock...</i>

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.700
<i>Paper...</i>

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:27.600
<i>Scissors!</i>

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:31.520
She saw how Nya-tan's fingers 
were going to move!

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.130
The ultimate delayed-play foul!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.200
Wow...

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.480
That's Usa-tan's super high speed power.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:37.670
You knew about it?

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.280
No, this is my first time learning of it.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:45.040
And next is the "look that way" moment.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.230
Time...

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:50.690
Stop!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:52.740
That was forceful!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.960
It appeared she had plenty 
of time to do it.

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:58.190
She got a lot done in that time!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.110
Incredible.

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.050
This is something only Usa-tan,

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:05.380
with her super high speed power, could do.

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:07.580
Nya-tan's at a serious disadvantage now.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:08.460
What can she do?

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.070
Yes...

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.690
Her only hope is to have 
fortune on her side.

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.000
No way...

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.710
All right, for better or worse,

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:18.380
it's time for the last round!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:22.180
Rock...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.180
Paper...

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:26.640
I'm taking hold of my fortune!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:32.690
Me-ow!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:36.580
And then...

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:38.650
Look...

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.860
That way!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:41.110
That way!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.320
That way!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:58.590
<b>Rabbit</b>

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:01.170
Usa-tan's Sol/Lull Seal...

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.590
...is mine!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.030
<i>Battle is over.</i>

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.240
That was amazing, Nya-tan!

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.830
<i>Please shut down and start again.</i>

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.100
How exciting!

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:12.650
I did it!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.650
I took hold of my fortune!

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:18.360
But why'd you grab Usa-tan's 
foot like that?

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:20.360
It's a rabbit's foot.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:22.880
Rabbit's foot? Like this?

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.920
It's an accessory that humans have

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.620
carried for good luck since ancient times.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:30.370
I was careless...

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.660
So your feet are your erogenous 
zone, eh, Usa-tan?

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.380
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:38.400
It just hit me.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.520
That was erotic ecstasy in

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.810
your face and voice!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:48.520
I get it. Usa-tan was 
squirming as she lost.

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.930
I don't know if you'd call 
that good fortune or not...

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.710
Anyway, I'm one more step 
closer to the zodiac!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.720
Now, go ahead and produce me for free!

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.820
For free!

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:00.150
I suppose I'll have to.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.590
Here you go, then.

