production by Usa P.P.

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:27.480
That's impossible.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.680
Yes!

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.680
<b>Ah!</b>

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:31.550
I won't let you escape.

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:34.230
Not now that I've accepted 
your request to produce you!

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:35.930
Go for it, Nya-tan!

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:37.980
Turn awesome, like us!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:40.790
We'll cheer for you while we eat sukiyaki.

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:41.730
No!

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.500
Let's get started!

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.580
I don't wanna!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:47.050
I'll assist you, hand and butt!

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.620
